{"site":"douban","sid":"30210221","imdb_id":"tt9335498","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt9335498/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/30210221/","chinese_title":"鬼灭之刃","foreign_title":"鬼滅の刃","year":"2019","aka":["Demon Slayer","Kimetsu no Yaiba","灭鬼之刃","鬼灭之刃 灶门炭治郎 立志篇"],"region":["日本"],"genre":["动画","奇幻"],"language":["日语"],"playdate":["2019-04-06(日本)"],"episodes":"26","duration":"24分钟","description":"故事发生在日本大正时代。原本过着平凡无忧生活的灶门炭治郎（花江夏树 配音）和家人们，因为恶鬼的袭击而人生彻底发生转变。母亲和多个兄弟姐们遭到杀害，而幸存的妹妹祢豆子（鬼头明里 配音）受到鬼舞辻无惨（关俊彦 配音）之血的影响也化身恶鬼。为了给家人们报仇，并且解救妹妹，炭治郎拜入鳞泷左近次门下学习剑术，并最终通过严苛选拔成为一名鬼杀队剑士。在这一过程中，他结识了我妻善逸（下野纮 配音）、栗花落香奈乎（上田丽奈 配音）、嘴平伊之助（松冈祯丞 配音）等伙伴，也在试炼修行的过程中，注定要完成和鬼之始祖鬼舞辻无惨的宿命对决……\n本片根据日本漫画家吾峠呼世晴所著的少年漫画改编。","poster":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2551222097.jpg","douban_votes":"295189","douban_rating":"9.1","imdb_rating_average":"8.6","imdb_votes":"226200","imdb_rating":"8.6 / 10 from 226,200 users","director":[{"name":"外崎春雄 Sotozaki Haruo","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27578904/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/2a621274ead5a85669c65c6691b0b505.jpg"},{"name":"细川秀树 Hosokawa Hideki","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/34972424/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/19d5d083488941d0bcc0942c256f9ce5.jpg"},{"name":"间岛崇宽 Majima Takahiro","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/34972019/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"},{"name":"伊藤祐毅 Itou Yuuki","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/34980132/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"},{"name":"野中卓也 Nonaka Takuya","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/35019638/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/